# Varka Silenos support (VarkaSilenosSupport): the village folk of a Varka Silenos ally of level 4, each first talk answering by the level.
# One token is too few for a blessing of 3. Killing a soldier of the side breaks the alliance,
# the level 4 badge becoming the level 3 one.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (VarkaSilenosSupport.onFirstTalk, onAdvEvent,
# onMyDying) and replay the reference trace.
